p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752750/extras/fc7f49d36f23b630f67d106c0f5eaf6f.avif?t=1754033943\" width=528 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Bobbie </strong><br>She is a bar owner and Carol's lover/Girlfriend (they haven't yet figured out where they stand. She is a no-nonsense, funny woman. She is also close to both MC and Julie. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752750/extras/b34b59dcba50ae224692eb369a07f459.avif?t=1754033943\" width=555 height=720 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "One Lie is a choice-driven adult visual novel about a young man not having the best start to his adulthood. His best friend betrays him and he decides to start his life somewhere else. Will he find peace, love and new friendships? Of course, he will. With whom? That's up to you.",
